SY_TALK("_2NldGL5tcQ",[[1,["Shri Krishna Puja","Cabella Ligure, Italy"]],[3,["August 16, 1992"]],[513,["Today we have decided to have the puja of","Shri Krishna."]],[519,["We have many a times done this puja and have","understood the essence of Shri Krishna’s"]],[532,["advent, which was six thousand years back."]],[536,["And now, what His manifestation was, what","He wanted to be accomplished has to be done"]],[555,["in this Kali Yuga."]],[560,["As it is, this Kali Yuga is going into a new","realm of Satya Yuga, but in between there"]],[571,["is Krita Yuga where this Brahmachaitanya,","or we can say the all-pervading Power of God’s"]],[584,["love, is going to act."]],[587,["At this time, what is going to happen with","Shri Krishna’s powers – this is what we"]],[598,["have to see."]],[601,["Shri Krishna, as I told you, was the incarnation","also of diplomacy."]],[607,["So He plays around quite a lot, and ultimately","He brings forth the untruth and the falsehood;"]],[616,["but in doing that He judges people."]],[618,["So it’s very important that Shri Krishna’s","powers of His diplomacy were to be manifesting"]],[626,["at this time, when it is the Last Judgment."]],[632,["So now whatever we have done wrong before,","whatever karmas which have been done in ignorance"]],[645,["maybe, or maybe deliberately, all of them","will be paid back."]],[653,["Those punyas which you have done in previous","lives, this life, will be also rewarded."]],[661,["This is all done through Shri Krishna’s","principles of collectivity, where He collectively"]],[670,["sees the situation."]],[673,["For example, as I told you last time also","that Columbus luckily went to America; luckily,"]],[686,["so we were saved, otherwise we would not have","been here."]],[690,["And then these Spanish people, bullfighters,","they went and started fighting the poor, unarmed"]],[700,["people who were just very simple owners of","that land."]],[706,["But they went and occupied those lands, and","killed every one of them."]],[712,["So in America you can’t find anyone, no","doubt, but even in South America you have"]],[717,["to go to Colombia or to Bolivia, to great","heights, to see some aboriginals there; otherwise"]],[725,["most of them are finished."]],[728,["So now in Krita Yuga all these diseases have","started cropping up."]],[734,["But the best part is the drug addiction."]],[742,["These drugs are made, for your information,","in Bolivia and in Colombia."]],[751,["You drove them down there, so now you have","the drugs and very nicely you are very welcoming"]],[759,["them."]],[761,["People went in Nicaragua to help them and","brought back all these horrible drugs to Washington;"]],[773,["and in every elite society they are just discussing","which is the best drug, where is the sale"]],[778,["on and where should they buy the drugs."]],[782,["So the all of America is now worried how much","drug they can import, and kill themselves"]],[788,["and destroy themselves."]],[791,["So this destruction has started from inside."]],[797,["Then in addition to that, when I went there","first I told them not to indulge into these"]],[804,["Freudian practices but keep to morality, otherwise","you’ll have problems."]],[820,["So they had first AIDS, secondly now yuppie’s","disease, and all kinds of secret diseases"]],[832,["they have."]],[835,["Among ten people there would be at least one","person who is suffering from that, and among"]],[840,["twenty people there’ll be at least one person","who must be suffering from schizophrenia."]],[845,["Because they made every person, every other","country nervous, so now they are getting schizophrenia."]],[854,["Like this we can see even in England."]],[860,["Now in England they came to India as traders,","ordinary traders, and plundered us completely,"]],[872,["no doubt, ruled us for three hundred years","– as I say, it’s gracious hospitality"]],[878,["they had – and then they left us in three","pieces."]],[886,["And now in their own country there are problems,","all kinds."]],[890,["First of all nobody wants to call themselves","as English; they all call themselves Welsh"]],[898,["or Scots, or specially the Irish."]],[903,["And there is always a bomb scare in London,","every time, and for our first program also"]],[908,["there was a bomb scare."]],[911,["So you can imagine these English who tried","to divide us are automatically divided among"]],[917,["themselves, and now fighting each other."]],[919,["But there are other problems also like AIDS","and immoral life, everything like that."]],[926,["Same with the French."]],[928,["French tried to sell their wine all over,","and bring their horrible bathroom culture"]],[935,["everywhere."]],[936,["Now they are suffering from it."]],[939,["For example, most of the time they’re drunk","and they have lost all moorings, I mean, they"]],[945,["have no sense left in their heads."]],[947,["Like a housewife could be a prostitute – allowed","by law."]],[953,["All such things are happening."]],[956,["Now they are paying, and the worst that they","are paying, all these countries who think"]],[962,["no end of themselves, are recession."]],[966,["This is also Shri Krishna’s power, because","He’s Kubera."]],[972,["He’s the one who is the power of wealth."]],[975,["He gave lot of wealth to all these countries,","and now they don’t know what to do with"]],[981,["themselves."]],[982,["We can see in these fifty years how many things","have happened, but specially these twenty"]],[988,["years have been really remarkable."]],[991,["All over the world you can find out there","has been some sort of a complete change, or"]],[1001,["an exposure."]],[1002,["Even in Italy you see every day this Vatican","is here exposed, or some mafia connections"]],[1014,["are there, or this what you call, people from","the government are exposed."]],[1020,["I am doing nothing, I’m just sitting here,","but it is working out that way."]],[1028,["Since I have been here I don’t know how","many people have gone to jail, God knows."]],[1032,["(I don’t know if she’s not brought My","throat pastilles."]],[1036,["I had a bath early in the morning, so a little","bit … This is, Shri Krishna is trying to"]],[1044,["fill Me up!)"]],[1048,["We Indians are also suffering,because our","past deeds – like we had a caste system."]],[1066,["So now the caste system has become the greatest","headache for us in India, that’s the greatest"]],[1070,["cancer for us."]],[1072,["Like that, everywhere these twenty years or","twenty-one years have been … ( … I don’t"]],[1082,["know, because morning."]],[1087,["Also reaction on Me … ) So like that in","every country, you’ll see gradually, every"]],[1104,["country will have to face for what it has","done."]],[1111,["Also Shri Krishna’s own style was that He","can never believed in caste system."]],[1122,["He Himself was born in a caste which is a,","what you call is a milkman’s caste, and"]],[1132,["then He became a king, of course; but to begin","with, and He lived like an ordinary person."]],[1139,["He used to take the cows outside, look after","them and bring them home."]],[1145,["Now if you see His life you’ll find He is","absolutely very human, the way He used to"]],[1155,["tease His mother, tease other ladies."]],[1158,["All this is extremely human and childlike,","and extremely sweet."]],[1164,["But behind that also there was a great significance."]],[1168,["For example, Shri Radha – as you know, She","was Mahalakshmi – and as Mahalakshmi She"]],[1176,["used to put Her feet, take bath in the river","Yamuna, and the ladies would take water from"]],[1183,["the same river, carry on their head the pitchers."]],[1187,["Now Shri Krishna wanted to raise their kundalini,","so He used to hit them from the back so that"]],[1194,["the water falls on their back, and that vibrated","water would raise their kundalini."]],[1201,["This was His childish trick, but it had a","meaning."]],[1205,["Another one, when we see Him in ras – “ra”","means energy."]],[1211,["Radha: “ra” is “energy,” “dha”","means “the one who sustains it” – so"]],[1217,["it is Radhaji who had the energy."]],[1221,["“Sa” means “with,” so when they played","ras, was nothing but to play with the energy."]],[1228,["And that’s how He wanted to have a collective","awakening of people, of gopa and gopis, and"]],[1234,["He did it."]],[1235,["But then He had to leave and fight this Kamsa."]],[1238,["In His own lifetime, as a child or grown-up,","He punished all kinds of devils and women"]],[1246,["devils who were like Putna, and all that."]],[1250,["He did it, and in this Kali Yuga also He’s","active."]],[1256,["We have seen how gradually He has finished","so many false gurus, one by one; somebody"]],[1263,["who called himself Shri Krishna, somebody","who called himself as God, something else,"]],[1268,["something else."]],[1269,["He finished them all, exposed them nicely,","and now we have very few people in the arena"]],[1274,["left for us to fight."]],[1278,["They themselves are trembling and they are","quite frightened of us, because we are standing"]],[1281,["on truth."]],[1286,["So now, when we have to think about Shri Krishna","who is residing in our Vishuddhi Chakra."]],[1294,["Many people have this problem of left Vishuddhi."]],[1301,["That is because we are more sort of very social","people."]],[1310,["Now in the Western society, the social system","is so rigid that anybody can collapse with"]],[1316,["that, or used to be; now better because of","the, maybe the revolt, anti-culture."]],[1323,["But otherwise if you could put one spoon from","here to there, then you are finished."]],[1329,["If you start your food with, say, not with","the fish knife but with an ordinary knife,"]],[1336,["then you’re finished, you are no good."]],[1338,["And these French have made even much worse","by using a big science out of alcohol."]],[1346,["For this alcohol this is the glass, for that","alcohol that is the glass, and all that."]],[1353,["So the whole collective was made so rigid."]],[1357,["It’s much more rigid than in India."]],[1360,["I used to think Indian collective is quite","rigid because of certain conditionings we"]],[1366,["have, but after coming to the West I was surprised","that it is such a conditioning in the heads"]],[1377,["of the people, that some of the conditionings","you cannot remove – say from Catholic Church,"]],[1384,["you might say, or from wherever it is."]],[1386,["But when it comes from somebody like Freud","who was absolutely a devil, they just give"]],[1395,["up all these conditionings and take to that."]],[1399,["I cannot understand any country where there","is Catholic Church so predominant, they are"]],[1406,["following Freud."]],[1407,["So this collective rigidity, which was then","because maybe Shri Rama was a very formal"]],[1417,["person, because of Him maybe the collective","rigidity might have been in India."]],[1424,["But in the West it is all mental, it’s absolutely","mental."]],[1430,["If you make this kind of hair then you are","all right, if you put oil then you are absolutely"]],[1436,["lunatic: all kinds of funny ideas were given,","and people started doing like this."]],[1443,["If you don’t put oil at all you’ll become","bald."]],[1445,["If you become bald, then they will have a","business of their wigs."]],[1449,["So the whole thing was money-oriented, and","everything was made so fixed that you had"]],[1455,["to do it so that they could sell their things."]],[1458,["England was, as you know, is tailcoat: you","have to wear a tailcoat if you have to see"]],[1463,["the Queen."]],[1464,["I don’t know why you have to wear a tailcoat","to see the Queen, but it’s compulsory, and"]],[1470,["if you don’t wear then you are not allowed."]],[1473,["So they have to borrow these tailcoats and","all that from one shop, which can be tight,"]],[1478,["which can be loose, and everybody looks like","Charlie Chaplin to Me!"]],[1484,["They can’t walk straight."]],[1488,["So this kind of stupid rigidity that came","into the West has really made them very nervous."]],[1501,["People are so nervous here."]],[1502,["If you tell some lady that “I am going to","come and have food with you,” she will collapse."]],[1511,["God knows what she thinks, I mean, it is caring","for the public opinion, or her own conditioning."]],[1518,["But in an Indian, a housewife, if you tell","her you are going to come, she’ll be the"]],[1524,["happiest person."]],[1526,["She’ll be very happy that you are coming","to her house for dinner."]],[1530,["But here even if you say, “I would like","to come and see you in the evening,” they’ll"]],[1535,["say, “All right, come in the pub.”"]],[1537,["Because they’re so nervous, they’re not","sure of themself; and this has come, I think,"]],[1544,["perhaps from these norms that there have been","created in the West."]],[1548,["In India also we had lots of these ritualism","that came up very serious."]],[1557,["Like we had people, Jainis who’d pick up","their hair with their hands."]],[1565,["They are not supposed to use any knives or","any scissors or any barbers, so they were"]],[1577,["supposed to pick up their hair on their own."]],[1579,["So from their beard, from their this thing,","they would pick up all the time."]],[1584,["That went to such a horrible conditioning","that they would say that if you, even if you"]],[1592,["breathe then you can, you might consume some","animals."]],[1597,["So they would put some sort of a cloth before","their mouth, and all kinds of nonsense they"]],[1602,["did."]],[1603,["At that time Shri Krishna came in."]],[1608,["His own cousin was a tirthankara, you’ll","be surprised, Neminath."]],[1615,["He became a tirthankara, and that made Shri","Krishna think about it, that this kind of"]],[1624,["stupid ritualism that we have."]],[1626,["Like in the morning women will get up, in","their sleep they will go, put some water for"]],[1632,["tulsi, do this thing, that thing, throw water","here and there."]],[1636,["And also the untouchables and touchables;","and you can’t take water from this, you"]],[1642,["can’t eat this, you can’t move like that","– all kinds of restrictions, timing, everything."]],[1649,["This time is not good, that time is not good,","this you should not do, that you should not"]],[1653,["do, to such an extent that the whole movement","of our country was round these rituals."]],[1665,["I had nephews who used to come to Bombay for","their work."]],[1669,["Every time they went to Lucknow, they would","come with shaven heads."]],[1672,["I said, “What’s the matter?”"]],[1674,["He said, “There are many people in our family","who are old, and when they die we have to"]],[1677,["shave our heads.”"]],[1678,["So every time they went there somebody died,","so they came with shaven heads."]],[1683,["Like that such horrible rituals existed, and","even now in the South India there is a lot"]],[1690,["of rituals are there, terrible rituals, and","they cannot get out of it, they’re frightened."]],[1695,["If they get out of it then they might be sinners,","or they will go to hell."]],[1702,["So the Indian conditioning was, as far as","these rigidities were concerned for religion,"]],[1710,["to be on the right side in such a way that","we should not be caught up without doing this."]],[1718,["So early in the morning they’ll get up and","do the rituals, just without even thinking"]],[1723,["about what they’re doing."]],[1728,["But in the West the lifestyle is nothing but","rigidity, the whole lifestyle is; there’s"]],[1734,["no freedom anywhere."]],[1736,["And all that then was rewarded by these hippies","and other people, and all of them, and they"]],[1742,["fought it, and that thing went to another","extremes."]],[1746,["So from one extreme to another extreme they","went."]],[1751,["Now, how Shri Krishna’s advent changed it."]],[1757,["When Shri Krishna came on this Earth, He said","this is all a leela, it is just a play."]],[1768,["Because you are involved into it, you cannot","see the play."]],[1773,["But if you ascend – if you are in the water","you are afraid of the water, but if you get"]],[1781,["into the boat you can see the water, and if","you know how to swim you can even save the"]],[1789,["people who are in the water."]],[1791,["So He says that if you develop a witness state,","sakshi swarupata, if you develop that state"]],[1800,["then you see the whole thing as a drama."]],[1804,["Nothing affects you."]],[1806,["Nothing matters, you don’t worry about anything,","you see the problem above; you are, and you"]],[1812,["see the problem, and because you are out of","it, you can solve the problem."]],[1816,["This was His great advent, I would say, that","has taught the first step towards the ascent,"]],[1826,["is that you have to become a sakshi."]],[1829,["You have to become the witness."]],[1831,["Now let’s see in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1836,["In Sahaja Yoga there are different types of","people come from different areas, from different"]],[1843,["cultures, because the door is open to everyone."]],[1848,["Now if an Indian comes in, he will be all","the time watchful about others, and will say"]],[1857,["that “Mother, this man is not doing this,","this man is not doing that."]],[1862,["He should have done footsoaking.”"]],[1864,["He’ll find faults with others, all the time","saying that this man is not doing like this,"]],[1872,["and you know."]],[1873,["But in the West they start finding faults","with themselves."]],[1878,["And I receive letters, ten to twelve pages","sometimes, confessing what wrong they have"]],[1884,["done."]],[1885,["Who is interested to know, what wrongs you","have done?"]],[1890,["I mean, if a lotus is born, nobody wants to","know how many filthy things are inside the"]],[1900,["pond."]],[1901,["You are now a lotus."]],[1905,["But it’s so common that they think we must","confess, we must tell Mother what wrong we"]],[1912,["have done."]],[1913,["Every moment you are changing, so what is","there to confess?"]],[1916,["And the life is so formal, as I told you,","that people suffer from guilt for anything."]],[1924,["Apart from the influence of this Catholic","Church has conditioned you so much that even"]],[1932,["if you are not a Catholic, you’re a Protestant,","still you have guilt, and as a guilt you develop"]],[1937,["this left Vishuddhi."]],[1940,["So then this left Vishuddhi is Vishnumaya","– means what?"]],[1947,["Once you have this left Vishuddhi you develop","all the problems of the Vishnumaya, and one"]],[1955,["of them is the heart."]],[1958,["Because Vishnumaya is an active thing, She","is like electricity; and if you have Vishnumaya"]],[1966,["problem, then you become lethargic."]],[1970,["“Oh, I’m so guilty.”"]],[1972,["You become depressed."]],[1973,["That Vishnumaya Principle disappears from","you."]],[1977,["She’s the one who’s quick, fast, and She","gives the light, and announces to the whole"]],[1986,["world what Shri Krishna is."]],[1989,["While what happens with such people, Sahaja","yogis who come in, who feel guilty, they say,"]],[1996,["“Mother, You know, we thought that if we","do this then our ego will come up."]],[2002,["If we do any work outside and work in some","fields or in some villages, then our ego will"]],[2009,["come up."]],[2010,["So we don’t want to do it.”"]],[2013,["This is absurd."]],[2015,["It’s like you give light to some light,","and the light says that “I don’t want"]],[2021,["to give the light, because maybe this light","might develop an ego.”"]],[2028,["It is absurd."]],[2029,["But such absurd things Sahaja yogis tell Me."]],[2035,["For them one has to understand, to get out","of this left Vishuddhi is to become absolutely"]],[2042,["dynamic in Sahaja Yoga, go all out into Sahaja","Yoga."]],[2048,["Otherwise they can’t get rid of their left","Vishuddhis."]],[2052,["Left Vishuddhi is a thing that’s a very","depressive action on the whole being, and"]],[2062,["a person who has left Vishuddhi is always","a very slow person to do anything for Sahaja"]],[2070,["Yoga."]],[2071,["You have not been given light to hide it."]],[2073,["Christ has said that you don’t put light","under the table."]],[2079,["So you have been given light to work it out,","to be dynamic, to think what to do, how to"]],[2086,["arrange, how to organize."]],[2088,["But if you are guilty, then you will all the","time say, “Oh Mother, it’s very difficult,"]],[2094,["You know, this . . .” Always you’ll find","the other side of the whole joke, just to"]],[2100,["avoid."]],[2101,["Now for a Sahaja yogi is to witness himself,","first of all."]],[2104,["That is the introspection."]],[2106,["He should see for himself, “Where was I,","and I have come here.”"]],[2111,["Don’t indulge too much in the past, but","see the distance you have crossed in such"]],[2116,["a short time."]],[2118,["Now you have come into the Kingdom of God,","you have all the powers."]],[2123,["I don’t tell lies – it’s a fact."]],[2126,["I’ll give you an example, if Wolfgang allows","Me to say that."]],[2133,["Wolfgang was with Me when we were traveling","from Prague to Vienna and the plane, you see,"]],[2144,["he told Me that the plane is at ten-thirty,","but it was at nine-thirty; it was a mistake."]],[2147,["It’s all right, there can be mistake, of","course, that also is Shri Krishna’s style."]],[2152,["You can always do mistakes, doesn’t matter."]],[2156,["So we reached – I mean, why all these things","happen, see, to create an event, a ghatna."]],[2163,["So he was very upset about it that he told","Me a wrong time, and I reached there about"]],[2168,["fifteen minutes late."]],[2169,["And there was a ground hostess, horrible,","she started shouting at Me, saying all kinds,"]],[2174,["“It’s not fair, You don’t know,” this,","that and everything."]],[2178,["I just didn’t bother about it because I","knew that it was out of mistake we’ve done"]],[2184,["it."]],[2185,["And they could have taken away their plane","instead of shouting, but they kept the plane"]],[2188,["and shouted at Me, because she wanted to shout,","you see."]],[2196,["Then the plane was filled in with people and","it would not leave, so I asked the engineers."]],[2206,["They said, “It has been like this for the","half-an-hour."]],[2208,["We are trying to correct it."]],[2210,["It’s like this.”"]],[2211,["So it’s all right."]],[2213,["He said that “We’ll have to wait till","we put it right.”"]],[2220,["But because she shouted at Me, Wolfgang was","full of tears, you see; just look at this"]],[2227,["German having so many tears in his eyes!"]],[2230,["Then Alga was telling him that “It’s all","right, doesn’t matter."]],[2234,["It’s not your mistake.”"]],[2235,["He was feeling so sad that Mother has been","insulted like this by this lady, because of"]],[2241,["my mistake – I mean, it’s love."]],[2243,["Now the power of his love was so great."]],[2246,["At the same moment there were so many, to","about fifty people, Sahaja yogis standing"]],[2251,["on the balcony watching us."]],[2253,["We also felt and they also felt, but they","felt a tremendous cool breeze like a big blow"]],[2261,["came to them and blew upon them vibrations,","and they just got enamored."]],[2267,["And suddenly when they opened their eyes what","they find, the whole sky was filled with clouds."]],[2271,["There was not a single cloud."]],[2273,["In one second, in one second from where the","clouds came, God knows."]],[2278,["It was all completely filled with them."]],[2281,["Then they asked us to get out because they","could not do anything."]],[2285,["So when we came back it started raining."]],[2288,["When we came in, he got after that lady."]],[2291,["He said, “Now, whom are we to shout?"]],[2293,["We can’t catch our planes now.”"]],[2296,["And then they announced that all the flights","are cancelled."]],[2301,["So see the power of his love for his Mother","that the whole sky couldn’t bear it, you"]],[2308,["see, the, his eyes became the sky."]],[2311,["And in a second they said, “Mother, we have","never seen such a miracle, that there is not"]],[2317,["one single thing and the whole thing was filled","with this.”"]],[2322,["So you must know your powers."]],[2325,["That is what is – first of all witness yourself,","is the introspection."]],[2329,["See for yourself how many powers you have","got."]],[2334,["Now with your left Vishuddhi you will always","conclude, “Oh, how can I have any powers?"]],[2340,["After all, I have done this, I have done that.”"]],[2344,["Even if you give somebody hundred pounds and","you tell him that now you go to the market,"]],[2351,["buy something, he’ll say, “Oh, what’s","the use of this hundred pounds?” this, that."]],[2357,["Use it!"]],[2358,["As simple as that."]],[2360,["But then Sahaja yogis start saying that “No,","no, no, no."]],[2365,["Mother says, but how can I have?"]],[2367,["How can I have these powers, after all?"]],[2370,["It’s not possible."]],[2371,["I’m no good.”"]],[2372,["Because that left Vishuddhi’s all the time","telling that you are good for nothing."]],[2377,["It’s like a leaking hole in your brain that","takes away all the sense, and you accept it."]],[2387,["So first thing is to introspect yourself,","and see for yourself how many powers you have"]],[2393,["got."]],[2394,["Like in the beginning no Sahaja yogi would","give realization, in India."]],[2399,["Nobody would even touch anyone."]],[2402,["It so happened that My car failed and I was","late two hours, luckily, and there was a big"]],[2408,["meeting and they didn’t know what to do,","so they started giving realization to people."]],[2412,["And then they realized they can give realization;","otherwise they would not touch anyone."]],[2419,["Now you know that what you can do."]],[2422,["You also know that whatever you say happens."]],[2426,["Whatever you want you can get it."]],[2427,["Try, try, try!"]],[2428,["But if you don’t do it, then you’ll be","all the time half-baked."]],[2433,["Take the experience of your powers, see how","dynamic you are."]],[2439,["Don’t have formalities about it, just use","it fully, and you will be amazed that you"]],[2444,["have so many powers."]],[2447,["Somebody told Me that “Mother, You have","given a siddhi to Guido.”"]],[2450,["I have given siddhi to all of you."]],[2453,["I never discriminate; but it’s only he is","very brave, he’s used it left and right."]],[2457,["He uses left and right."]],[2460,["If you do not use your siddhis, what can I","do?"]],[2462,["I’ve given you all the siddhis, no doubt","about it, so try."]],[2468,["Like in the beginning Baba Mama told Me that","“How can I write a poem?"]],[2472,["I feel like writing but I am rather frightened,","because I could not even write an essay.”"]],[2477,["I used to write essay for all My brothers,","you see, when they were studying."]],[2483,["I was very good at languages."]],[2487,["But that’s what he said, and now look at","him!"]],[2489,["I told him, “You go ahead and write whatever","you write.”"]],[2492,["He said, “I may write something wrong.”"]],[2494,["“It doesn’t matter."]],[2495,["Write it.”"]],[2496,["In the same way, somebody wants to paint something,","one should not think how they will criticize"]],[2501,["or anything – just paint."]],[2506,["If you want to sing, just sing."]],[2507,["If you want to do anything, any manifestation,","just do it boldly."]],[2512,["Go in a big way."]],[2514,["You’ll be amazed at yourself how you have","achieved it and how you are doing it."]],[2517,["It has worked with so many artists, you know","that."]],[2521,["That day Debu told you about himself, and","in so many they can tell you that this has"]],[2526,["happened to them."]],[2528,["So now the first thing is to know that you","have powers."]],[2531,["Now believe in them."]],[2532,["Have faith in yourself."]],[2533,["If you have left Vishuddhi, this Vishnumaya","won’t work out."]],[2538,["But be like Vishnumaya."]],[2541,["Just give up this guilt."]],[2543,["“No, I am a Sahaja yogi."]],[2545,["I’m not an ordinary person.”"]],[2547,["People sometimes talk to Me and I say, “Do","you know what you are?”"]],[2552,["“What, Mother?”"]],[2553,["“You are a Sahaja yogi.”"]],[2555,["“Oh, I forgot.”"]],[2558,["“Now go and do it.”"]],[2563,["And the another style of this left Vishuddhi","is this, which one must understand, that it"]],[2571,["tries to give an explanation."]],[2573,["As I told you many a time, you tell somebody","that telephone to someone."]],[2577,["First they will say, “He may not be there,","Mother.”"]],[2581,["“Baba, you telephone!"]],[2582,["First find out if he may be there or may not","be there.”"]],[2588,["But they would not."]],[2590,["They would just avoid, and that is another","thing."]],[2593,["Vishnumaya never avoids, you have seen that."]],[2596,["Once She has to shine She shines, wherever","She is, whatever She is."]],[2601,["So in the same way we have to be like that."]],[2604,["We have to know that we are special people,","we are chosen, we are angelic and that we"]],[2611,["have entered into the Kingdom of God, and","it will all work out."]],[2615,["Sahaja Yoga is not meant for useless people."]],[2618,["As I told you, in Marathi, Tukaram has said,","“Yeddya gabalyache kam nave.”"]],[2624,["It’s not meant for lunatics and lousy people."]],[2627,["It’s meant for somebody who has tyala pahijet","jatiche."]],[2631,["You need people of character."]],[2634,["I know that there cannot be many like that,","but there is no place in God’s realm for"]],[2640,["many people, for all these useless people."]],[2644,["It’s only for something special."]],[2647,["These seats are reserved and you have got","your realization now, somehow."]],[2652,["So now try to understand that this Vishnumaya","Principle has to be expressed and has to be"]],[2658,["shown, and you introspect yourself: have I","done that or not?"]],[2661,["Don’t be afraid that they say that “But","our ego will come up.”"]],[2666,["Doesn’t matter."]],[2667,["You will also see your ego."]],[2670,["This is the second part of Shri Krishna’s","play, that in this Krita Yuga you see your"]],[2676,["ego."]],[2677,["There was a lady who was rather not very kind","to some Maharashtrian ladies."]],[2684,["So I told her, “You have got right side.”"]],[2687,["She wouldn’t believe."]],[2688,["She came to see Me in Rome, and she fell down","on right side, completely."]],[2694,["Then she realized that her right side was","not all right."]],[2699,["So to know that, whether you have a right","or a left, there’s a very good method, is"]],[2705,["of meditation."]],[2706,["Now the third situation is that you must accept","whatever is wrong with you."]],[2714,["If you do not accept, then you have not been","kind to yourself."]],[2719,["That is the central part of it, that you must","accept, “Yes, this is something wrong with"]],[2726,["me."]],[2727,["I have gone in this part I’m wrong, of my","Vishuddhi, or that part I’m wrong."]],[2733,["So now I have to improve.”"]],[2735,["Now, right Vishuddhi people will always try","to correct Me."]],[2740,["I’ve seen it."]],[2741,["It’s very simple for them."]],[2744,["If I say anything, “No.”"]],[2746,["First words."]],[2747,["Different types “no’s” there are."]],[2749,["Sometimes, “No!”"]],[2750,["Sometimes it is “No, no, no, no, no, no,","no, no, no, no, no, no, no!”"]],[2760,["They will contradict Me or try to put their","own idea, and then they discover that it was"]],[2770,["wrong; they should not have said it."]],[2772,["Say for example, if I say, “I saw these","things lying here.”"]],[2778,["They said, “No.”"]],[2779,["I said, “I saw with My own eyes and once","I see something, you know, it’s registers,"]],[2786,["it’s there.”"]],[2787,["“No.”"]],[2788,["I say, “All right, just try to find out.”"]],[2790,["“It’s there."]],[2791,["How is it we didn’t see?”"]],[2794,["I said, “Because your ‘no’ was written","on your eyes, I think, you couldn’t see"]],[2800,["anything.”"]],[2801,["And then they’ll pull their ears – that’s","the best."]],[2806,["But if you see that “This is a habit I have","of saying no to things.”"]],[2812,["So first of all, I also test you."]],[2816,["Supposing I say it is just now nine o’clock","in the night, you just say yes; let’s see"]],[2821,["what happens."]],[2822,["Try to see."]],[2824,["You see, I test you many a times like this","and then I see that some people – if I say"]],[2834,["so, all right, if it’s so, if Mother has","said, it is so."]],[2839,["And then it starts building up their faith","very well."]],[2843,["I can see they’re, clearly how they are","coming into the realm of real faith, and there"]],[2855,["when I say something absurd they’ll just","smile."]],[2858,["They know it is Mother is just testing us,","you see, so they just smile."]],[2864,["They wouldn’t do anything, but they’ll","just smile."]],[2867,["And then if it is so and if they don’t know,","they’ll say, “Yes, it must be."]],[2873,["Mother must have done this or said so.”"]],[2876,["So your testing time is there."]],[2879,["You have to test yourself."]],[2881,["As Mohammed Sahib has said, that your hands","will speak and they’ll give witness against"]],[2886,["you – so on your hands you will know."]],[2889,["Now these hands are the blessings of Shri","Krishna."]],[2894,["They come out from the same Vishuddhi, and","as you know the pelvic nerves serves it on"]],[2901,["all that."]],[2902,["And there are two chakras of one Lalita, another","Shri Chakras, all on these both sides; they"]],[2909,["also play into the hands of Shri Krishna."]],[2912,["With these hands we can feel the vibrations."]],[2917,["Now if your right Vishuddhi’s too strong","you may not feel, if your left Vishuddhi’s"]],[2922,["too strong you may not feel, but that doesn’t","mean that you haven’t got realization."]],[2929,["You have got."]],[2930,["You just work out your hands."]],[2932,["Now for working your hands, you have to see","that you don’t use them for useless things."]],[2938,["That’s very important, because you have","special hands."]],[2943,["These hands are the ones with which you spread","the collectivity."]],[2950,["Now for example, Italy example this: here","the people when they talk, they’ll go on"]],[2961,["… They don’t know anything what they are","saying, they only know their own, all their"]],[2966,["gestures, and they only can depict."]],[2968,["For a person who doesn’t know them, on they’ll","go on like this, like this, all the time."]],[2974,["So this should be reduced."]],[2976,["There’s no need to use your hands so much","all the time, like this, like that."]],[2980,["Little bit, but while using the hands also","it should be decent, it should be regulated,"]],[2986,["it should be","very indicative and useful."]],[2995,["Just showing off your hands is not good."]],[2999,["It is some sort of a theory came out, I was","told, that you must put your gestures into"]],[3004,["your hands and speak."]],[3007,["Is all right for people like Hitler, but not","for us."]],[3010,["For us we should be decent."]],[3012,["We should, whenever we have to say – now","for example, you want to point out something"]],[3016,["to someone, shouldn’t say “do this.”"]],[3017,["This is Shri Krishna’s finger, you can’t","use it like that."]],[3021,["Let them do, means supporting everything."]],[3027,["This looks better."]],[3030,["These hands are to be used for collectivity."]],[3032,["See, we say “namaste” when we meet others."]],[3036,["To thousands of people we can say “namaste.”"]],[3039,["But I don’t like the shaking hands business","because it’s no good."]],[3043,["Shaking hands doesn’t create any collectivity."]],[3045,["On the contrary, you might get all kinds of","pins and needles and all kinds of problems"]],[3049,["from others."]],[3051,["But when you talk to people also, with these","hands only you can feel them; with these hands"]],[3060,["only you can care for your children; with","these hands only you can suggest your softness,"]],[3068,["your sweetness, and also with the mouth – which","is of course is a part of the Vishuddhi, that’s"]],[3075,["different – but specially hands."]],[3077,["Your gestures and everything should show very","heartfelt emotions, and then only these gestures"]],[3087,["have some meaning."]],[3090,["Now in Sahaja Yoga as you know, you hold each","other’s hands and the vibration starts flowing"]],[3094,["among yourselves."]],[3095,["And you can also hear the tabla on your throbbings,","so that shows that they are the communication."]],[3104,["So these hands, which are really the beginning","of the collectivity – most important, I"]],[3110,["would say the most important things are the","hands, which act for your collectivity."]],[3119,["As far as you are concerned there are many","other angels and other ganas who are standing"]],[3127,["behind you."]],[3128,["They also, they extend their help to you whenever","you want to communicate something, they also"]],[3135,["do your jobs very well."]],[3137,["So whatever is expressed in your hand or through","your hand, they immediately pick up."]],[3147,["As you know that Vishuddhi has sixteen petals,","and all ear, nose, throat, eyes, all are guided"]],[3158,["by this."]],[3159,["Also the sub-plexus of this Vishuddhi is this","one, is the Hamsa Chakra."]],[3166,["So we have these eyes to see, eyes to communicate."]],[3173,["The pure eyes communicate pure love, purity."]],[3180,["With the pure eyes you can cleanse people,","with the pure eyes you can help others, you"]],[3189,["can bring peace."]],[3191,["The purification of the eyes takes place through","your Vishuddhi and Agnya."]],[3196,["Here both things have to work out."]],[3200,["The nose is very important."]],[3204,["Nose has to be pure, in the sense that you","should be able to discard whatever is smelling"]],[3214,["badly, and you should be able to accept whatever","is fragrant."]],[3219,["It’s very important, because nose is the","speciality of Shri Krishna, I would say, in"]],[3227,["the sense that He’s the Kubera, and the","Kubera has given the nose to the Goddess."]],[3235,["Some people have a bad habit of moving their","nose just to show disapproval or something"]],[3245,["like this, they go on doing like that."]],[3247,["This is very wrong, because then you are insulting","yourself, you’re insulting your Kubera power."]],[3254,["So you have to keep your nose in a dignified","manner."]],[3258,["It should be a dignified nose."]],[3260,["It should not be used for doing something","which is undignified, or which expresses contempt."]],[3267,["Then your teeth are very important."]],[3271,["You have thirty-two teeth, see: sixteen of","Krishna’s powers divided into, you can say,"]],[3279,["thirty-two."]],[3280,["These are your teeth on both the sides."]],[3286,["The right side is on top and the left down","below."]],[3291,["That is one thing we neglect very much in","the West, I must say."]],[3294,["In India it is not."]],[3295,["It is very much we neglect, and that’s what","we have to look after."]],[3300,["The reason for neglect is that, I would say,","is laziness, must be the laziness, but at"]],[3311,["least twice or thrice you must brush your","teeth."]],[3315,["Is important, that I need not say, but more","important is to change the brush."]],[3322,["Also you have to use butter, or salt and oil","to rub your gums."]],[3332,["If you rub your gums properly, you will never","have problems with your teeth and your gums."]],[3341,["Moreover, every time in the evening you must","again brush your teeth."]],[3346,["I’ve seen many people who come to Me in","the evening in the program, such a horrible"]],[3351,["smell from their mouth comes out."]],[3353,["It is not that it’s a disease but it is,","only thing is that they have not cleansed"]],[3357,["their teeth."]],[3359,["Also there are people who will not even brush","their teeth, and start eating breakfast."]],[3364,["I don’t know, it was another theory started,","I think, that you can eat your food without"]],[3368,["brushing."]],[3369,["Teeth are very important, and one must look","after them."]],[3374,["On the teeth it depends all the qualities","of your Vishuddhi."]],[3384,["So one has to look after the teeth in a proper","way, and should never clench and never show"]],[3394,["temper with the teeth."]],[3396,["It’s a very bad habit."]],[3397,["Also here is a gesture I have seen that if","they don’t like something, they just go"]],[3400,["on like this."]],[3401,["It’s a very wrong thing."]],[3404,["One should avoid that kind of a gesture, and","it’s very dangerous for your teeth."]],[3412,["So today’s lecture is more sort of medical,","I must say."]],[3421,["A person who is spiritually endowed has an","expression which can never be aggressive."]],[3437,["He may not be good-looking, may not be very,","a sort of a attractive personality, but the"]],[3445,["expression on the face is absolutely saintly."]],[3452,["That is also the blessings of Shri Krishna."]],[3457,["I have seen people after one year of realization,","and I was surprised how their faces were changed,"]],[3470,["that I could not recognize them who they were."]],[3474,["The whole thing becomes absolutely mild, soft,","peaceful and very joyous."]],[3482,["All the qualities of Shri Krishna can be expressed","on your face."]],[3488,["You can be sometimes mischievous to look at."]],[3491,["So many expressions there are which come on","the face, and give you a very sweet feeling."]],[3502,["But some people have a habit of looking in","the mirror all the time, which is very wrong,"]],[3507,["because it gives you a kind of a funny ego."]],[3510,["Is better to look at Shri Krishna’s photograph","than to look at your own faces, so that your"]],[3516,["face will become like that of Shri Krishna;","instead of you start looking in the mirror"]],[3520,["all the time."]],[3521,["What will become of you, God knows, because","maybe if you go to your past, God knows what"]],[3526,["you’ll become."]],[3528,["So also I’m thankful to psychiatrists that","they don’t like narcissism."]],[3532,["But it’s very dangerous to all the time","watch your face in the mirror, very dangerous."]],[3537,["It creates a very funny personality, that","you start telling yourself, “Oh, I’m Napoleon.”"]],[3542,["So you become Napoleon, and start behaving","like Napoleon."]],[3547,["Next day you find one Napoleon walks out of","the bathroom!"]],[3552,["So one has to be careful not to pay so much","attention and importance to your own self,"]],[3561,["but to your Self which is within, which is","your spirit."]],[3564,["And if you look after that side, then all","these things will happen in such a beautiful"]],[3571,["manner."]],[3572,["Also the hair are looked after by Shri Krishna."]],[3576,["Now you see, you know that He’s very fond","of anything that is like butter, so you have"]],[3582,["to put either butter or oil or something in","your hair."]],[3586,["If you don’t put it you’ll become bald."]],[3588,["What can – I mean it is after all a karma","phala."]],[3593,["If you don’t put oil, you’ll become bald."]],[3595,["So you have to put oil, and oil was put always","before in the West."]],[3601,["I see all these old films and all that, they’re","all oiled people."]],[3605,["But now of course, if you don’t want to","put oil in the daytime you can wash it off,"]],[3610,["but at least once a week you must oil your","head."]],[3616,["Shri Krishna’s star is Saturn, Shani."]],[3621,["They say that if He gets after somebody, then","nobody can be saved."]],[3630,["If Shri Krishna gets after someone, then nobody","can be saved."]],[3634,["In the same way, if Saturn gets after someone","then that person is finished, so we say it’s"]],[3640,["for sometimes, it is seven years He’s after","you, or sometimes two-and-a-half years after"]],[3644,["you."]],[3645,["So this Saturn of Shri Krishna is a, it’s","a quality within us that, supposing if somebody"]],[3657,["troubles us or does something, we don’t","have to do anything."]],[3662,["Now this Shri Krishna policy, this, we can","say, the Shri Krishna’s nature will work"]],[3671,["it out."]],[3673,["It will inform this all-pervading Power, and","through that this man or this woman, or this"]],[3683,["party or this organization which is trying","to trouble us will be hounded, while we’ll"]],[3687,["be just sitting doing nothing."]],[3688,["They’ll be just hounded till they jump in","the sea."]],[3694,["[missing part] plays around, but","He doesn’t forgive."]],[3698,["He doesn’t believe in forgiveness."]],[3700,["He says, “Now, you had enough of it.”"]],[3703,["He gives a big, big long rope to hang yourself,","but He never forgives."]],[3710,["One thing for definite, He never forgives."]],[3713,["As you must have seen in Mahabharata His own","judgment of things, you see, He doesn’t"]],[3718,["forgive."]],[3719,["He says, “You have to pay."]],[3720,["You have to pay for it.”"]],[3723,["Except when, when you transcend."]],[3728,["If you become a Sahaja yogi, if you have transcended","Vishuddhi, then He cannot do anything like"]],[3742,["that to you."]],[3743,["But if you have not, if there’s no ascent","you cannot be saved, you cannot be saved from"]],[3750,["Him."]],[3751,["They say once Mohammed Gajani came to loot","our country – I mean, it’s a story about"]],[3756,["the village folk."]],[3759,["And there he’s looted Somnath, a big temple","of ours, which had lots of gold, jewelry,"]],[3765,["everything in it."]],[3767,["So these brahmins were, you see, taking money","from all these people and looting them, and"]],[3772,["putting them in the temple and using them,","and the rest of the people were very poor."]],[3780,["So it was sort of a reaction in them, and","the story they tell like this: so this Mohammed"]],[3788,["Gajani looted Somnath, is the temple of Mahadeva."]],[3793,["Now Mahadeva never needs any ornaments or","anything, but they had put this there."]],[3799,["So Hanumana saw that Mahadeva got out of the","temple and was running, so Hanumana ran after"]],[3807,["Him."]],[3808,["Then at one point Mahadeva sat down, and Hanumana","came."]],[3813,["He said, “You are the God of Gods."]],[3816,["Why are You running?"]],[3817,["What are You afraid of?”"]],[3819,["He said, “You don’t know this Mohammed","Gajani?”"]],[3821,["He said, “No I don’t know.”"]],[3823,["“All right, hide behind a tree.”"]],[3825,["They hid behind a tree."]],[3826,["So this Mohammed Gajani came and sat down","– this is the folklore I’m telling, folk"]],[3830,["people tell – sat down under that tree."]],[3834,["And turning to Shri Krishna, he said, “This","horrible thing, if He gets after someone,"]],[3840,["who can be saved?"]],[3842,["Under my nose these brahmins were making money","and all that, putting it in Somnath temple,"]],[3847,["which was not to be done."]],[3849,["I couldn’t do anything, so He came, and","with this fellow after me I cannot be saved"]],[3854,["either, so I am running away from the temple.”"]],[3858,["So this is the story given by the villagers,","but which shows that if Shri Krishna is after"]],[3865,["somebody, then nobody can save that person,","he has to run away; because He has so many"]],[3869,["tricks and so many styles that you can’t","get out of it."]],[3874,["He’ll use His brains in so many manners,","and that He’ll put that person right who"]],[3879,["is trying to trouble you."]],[3881,["So you must have complete faith in the powers","of Shri Krishna which is within yourself,"]],[3889,["which is being aware now."]],[3891,["And also if you have ascended fully out of","this, then He will not trouble; but if you"]],[3897,["have left Vishuddhi He will trouble you, definitely."]],[3901,["If you have left Vishuddhi Shri Krishna will","definitely trouble you, and be careful."]],[3904,["So get rid of your left Vishuddhis now."]],[3907,["That’s very important."]],[3908,["Because then Shri Krishna will take your test","and will make you so miserable that you will"]],[3914,["not know why."]],[3916,["“Mother, You see, I did this, I did this","puja, I did this till, let’s see now, this"]],[3920,["is the situation in my family."]],[3923,["This is what happened.”"]],[3924,["“All right, are you a Catholic?”"]],[3927,["“Yes.”"]],[3928,["“Feel guilty?”"]],[3929,["“Yes.”"]],[3930,["“So have it.”"]],[3932,["What can I do?"]],[3933,["Shri Krishna cannot be controlled by anyone."]],[3936,["He does whatever He thinks proper and He is","meant to really punish much more than the"]],[3942,["Mother, I can tell you."]],[3945,["They say that She’s Adi Rudra, Adi Saumya:","She’s the one who’s very hard and also"]],[3951,["very, very soft, but up to a point."]],[3955,["He is not."]],[3957,["Nothing can convince Him."]],[3958,["Once you get into His control, that He’ll","see to it that you are put right, left, right,"]],[3965,["any way He’ll make you all right."]],[3968,["So one thing is there, that you should be","sure that you should have your Vishuddhis"]],[3973,["all right, first of all, and also get Shri","Krishna manifesting on others."]],[3980,["You don’t have to do anything."]],[3982,["He’ll look after you, everything, and work","it out."]],[3984,["But left Vishuddhi is a disease of the West."]],[3988,["I also feel so much from you all that I sometimes","feel like running away to India, because in"]],[3993,["India nobody feels guilty."]],[3995,["They don’t believe in feeling guilty."]],[3997,["“What is there?"]],[3998,["We have not murdered anyone."]],[4000,["Why should we feel guilty?”"]],[4002,["Here it is a disease with everyone, “I feel","guilty.”"]],[4005,["I don’t know who has introduced this idea,","maybe this Catholic Church, but carried too"]],[4012,["far."]],[4013,["So then we come to the Virata's point, is","here."]],[4019,["Before that we have to cross the Hamsa; without","that you cannot reach the Virat point."]],[4026,["So Hamsa is as you know very well, is the","discretion, divine discretion, which must"]],[4033,["be within you."]],[4036,["Once you develop that, then you don’t commit","mistakes."]],[4041,["You never commit mistakes – mistakes in","the sense you don’t do things which are"]],[4047,["again pushed back on you, or for which you","have to pay."]],[4049,["It’s just a very straightforward life."]],[4052,["“It’s so?"]],[4054,["It’s so.”"]],[4055,["With this discretion, absolutely you have","a complete understanding as to what has to"]],[4061,["be done and what not to be done."]],[4064,["And if that is established, a discretion is","established."]],[4067,["In many Sahaja yogis, I must say, discretion","has come even with their left Vishuddhi."]],[4072,["Even if they have left Vishuddhi they have","this discretion, they know what is right and"]],[4076,["what is wrong."]],[4077,["With that divine discretion, the first thing","that happens is that people get impressed"]],[4084,["by you."]],[4085,["It’s real collectivity, it impresses the","collectivity."]],[4087,["A person who has divine discretion, people","immediately see the wisdom of that person"]],[4093,["and think, “See now, this man, how could","he be?"]],[4095,["He’s so young, how could he be?"]],[4097,["He’s such a child, how could he be?”"]],[4100,["So this divine discretion which is the, here,","Hamsa Chakra’s speciality, when it starts"]],[4110,["manifesting then automatically you impress,","automatically you impress the collectivity."]],[4118,["This is a very important point one has to","know."]],[4122,["While introspecting yourself, you just see","if you have developed this quality of divine"]],[4128,["discretion or not."]],[4129,["For example, there are many I have seen when","they come to the program, they come and tell"]],[4133,["Me, “Mother, some Sahaja yogi told me that","‘You have a bhoot.’"]],[4136,["Have I got a bhoot in me?”"]],[4139,["I said, “Not at all."]],[4140,["How can there be any bhoot in you?”"]],[4143,["He may be having, but the divine discretion","is not to tell him just now, but to remove"]],[4149,["it."]],[4150,["So divine discretion gives you a complete","understanding what is the way to handle another"]],[4161,["personality, what is the way to handle a collective,","how to talk to others, how to impress on them"]],[4169,["the right things."]],[4170,["It’s a very, very expansive manifestation","in so many directions."]],[4178,["If you have no divine discretion, you’ll","start speaking what you should not speak,"]],[4182,["you’ll start saying at a time when you should","not say."]],[4187,["I mean, you’ll have no sense at all of any","direction."]],[4191,["So to have divine discretion is very important,","for which as you know, Hamsa Chakra physically"]],[4198,["as well mentally and also spiritually must","be kept all right."]],[4203,["In My Hamsas – we had one puja where I talked","about it."]],[4210,["The last is the Virat: that is the state you","have to reach."]],[4214,["Is the Virat is here in front, as you know."]],[4219,["And I was surprised when I went to Nepal,","which is a temple of Shiva there: despite"]],[4229,["they were worshipping Shiva they were putting","all the kumkum here."]],[4234,["So I thought that they don’t know why they","are putting, because even if you worship Shiva"]],[4239,["you must also worship here, the Virata."]],[4242,["They don’t put it here – here; because","they’re absolutely hundred percent only"]],[4250,["Shiva worshippers, so why should they put","it here?"]],[4255,["Because somebody who knows, who was gnostic,","has told them that this is the place of Virat."]],[4265,["Once you get into Virata, then all your ideas","of separating or differentiating goes away."]],[4283,["You do not have any more ideas of races left,","of nationality, of your city, of your village"]],[4292,["or anything."]],[4293,["At that stage you don’t belong to any place."]],[4300,["You belong to every place, and you don’t","belong to every place."]],[4302,["Such a situation comes in when you don’t","hanker after any particular food, you don’t"]],[4307,["like any particular type of people, you can","adjust yourself into any circumstances, into"]],[4317,["any families, into any kind of people."]],[4322,["You can live with drunkards."]],[4324,["I mean I have lived with drunkards – “lived”","means I have shaken hands at least with so"]],[4331,["many of them."]],[4333,["You can be with any kind of person."]],[4336,["Nothing bothers you because you are in the","Virata state; because everything is absorbed"]],[4342,["by the Virat, and you do not feel anything."]],[4345,["Whatever sort of person may be, you do not","feel it."]],[4348,["The Virat has to suffer, not you, and that","is what is the best state where I want all"]],[4354,["of you to reach, and to become absolutely","free."]],[4360,["Nothing can impress you, nothing can influence","you, nothing can dissuade you, but you stand"]],[4366,["on your self-esteem and understanding about","yourself, that you’re a Sahaja yogi and"]],[4371,["that you are connected with this power, and","you are a citizen of Kingdom of God."]],[4381,["At the Virata state there's no doubt left","about it, no doubt, because you become part"]],[4393,["and parcel of the whole, absolutely, and you","can affect anywhere."]],[4397,["If this finger is hurt, then this finger can","feel it."]],[4400,["In the same way such a person is felt everywhere,","and not only that, but that person can be"]],[4409,["effective everywhere."]],[4411,["For that state of reaching to Virat, one should","try to slowly, gradually, “Ya neti neti"]],[4418,["vachanaih nirgama avochu” say."]],[4420,["You have to go on saying, “This is not my","sister."]],[4422,["This is not my brother."]],[4424,["They are all my brothers."]],[4426,["They’re all my sisters."]],[4427,["I love them the same as my sisters and my","brothers."]],[4431,["This is not my family."]],[4433,["The whole Sahaja Yoga is my family.”"]],[4436,["The whole attention should move like that."]],[4440,["“This is not only mine, it is everybody’s."]],[4444,["It belongs to everyone."]],[4447,["Everybody has a right.”"]],[4449,["That sort of a thing, when it starts growing","from individual, what we call is the “vestiti"]],[4454,["tu sumestiti” in Sanskrit, they say “vestiti","tu sumestiti,” from individual to collective."]],[4461,["And such a personality then is the most effective","one for any kind of collective work."]],[4468,["I think for today it’s quite sufficient","for you to know about Vishuddhi Chakra."]],[4472,["I mean, I have talked about it thousands and","thousands of times, and now this is one of"]],[4478,["the sides which I wanted to say, because I","find that still there are people who do not"]],[4483,["understand that they have to rise above Vishuddhi."]],[4486,["Otherwise, if they do not ascend over Vishuddhi","they can never be proper Sahaja yogis, they’ll"]],[4493,["be always half-baked."]],[4495,["So we must try to rise above the Vishuddhi,","the discretion part."]],[4502,["Then at that point we can never doubt Sahaja","Yoga, can never doubt, and that’s how the"]],[4509,["doubtless awareness can come to us."]],[4511,["May God bless you."]],[4526,["All right."]],[4528,["Shri Krishna Puja is very small that way,","not such a long thing."]]]);
